WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:12.326
&gt;&gt;&gt; WELCOME

00:00:12.327 --> 00:00:13.761
JESSE: WELCOME TO.

00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:15.563
"WATTERS' WORLD."

00:00:15.564 --> 00:00:17.732
I'M JESSE WATTERS.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:19.467
BY NOW EVERYBODY HEARD THE STORY

00:00:19.468 --> 00:00:22.770
OF THE COVINGTON BOYS.

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:25.539
WE'LL HAVE A SIT-DOWN WITH A

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.508
MEMBER OF THE COMMUNITY WHO

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:35.950
STARTED THE WHOLE THING, THE

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:37.051
BLACK ISRAELITES.

00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:38.219
PHILLIPS FIRST TOLD "THE

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.321
WASHINGTON POST" AND OTHER

00:00:40.322 --> 00:00:42.556
OUTLETS THAT HE WAS SURROUND AND

00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:45.159
HARASS BID THE COVINGTON BOYS.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.129
HE SAID THE BOYS WERE QUOTE

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.664
ATTACKING THESE FOUR BLACK

00:00:49.665 --> 00:00:50.464
INDIVIDUALS.

00:00:50.465 --> 00:00:53.668
HE CONTINUED, QUOTE, THESE YOUNG

00:00:53.669 --> 00:00:56.904
MEN WERE BEATLY AND THESE OLD

00:00:56.905 --> 00:00:58.572
BLACK INDIVIDUALS WAS THEIR

00:00:58.573 --> 00:00:59.340
PREY.

00:00:59.341 --> 00:01:01.308
PHILLIPS CALLED IT RACISM AND

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:04.478
THE HATRED IN THEIR CASES

00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:06.013
RESEMBLED WHRIN MUCHING THAT

00:01:06.014 --> 00:01:08.115
WERE DONE IN AMERICA.

00:01:08.116 --> 00:01:11.986
HE SAID THE STUDENTS WERE

00:01:11.987 --> 00:01:14.188
CHARNTING "BUILD THE WALL."

00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:17.158
ONCE THE COMPLETE VIDEO WAS

00:01:17.159 --> 00:01:19.193
RELEASED, EVERYTHING PHILLIPS

00:01:19.194 --> 00:01:20.227
SAID WAS A LIE.

00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:23.564
IT WAS PHILLIPS WHO APPROACHED

00:01:23.565 --> 00:01:25.466
THE BOYS AND BANGED THE DRUM IN

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.101
HIS FACE.

00:01:27.102 --> 00:01:29.970
NOBODY CHANTED "BUILD THE WALL."

00:01:29.971 --> 00:01:32.473
IT LOOKS LIKE PHILLIPS AND HIS

00:01:32.474 --> 00:01:34.809
CREW WERE THE AGGRESSORS WITH

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:34.843
THE

00:01:56.031 --> 00:01:59.066
JESSE: AFTER THE CONFRONTATION

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:02.369
WITH THE BOYS HE ATTEMPTED TO

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.338
DISRESULT MASS AT WASHINGTON,

00:02:04.339 --> 00:02:06.006
D.C.'S NATIONAL SHRINE.

00:02:06.007 --> 00:02:08.109
PHILLIPS AND 20 DEMONSTRATORS

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:09.777
TRIED TO FORCE THEMSELVES INTO

00:02:09.778 --> 00:02:12.179
EVENING MASS, BANG THEIR DRUMS

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.281
AND TOTALLY DIGS REPRESENT THE

00:02:14.282 --> 00:02:15.382
SERVICE.

00:02:15.383 --> 00:02:17.084
SECURITY CALLED THE SITUATION

00:02:17.085 --> 00:02:20.087
QUOTE TENSE AND HAD TO BLOCKADE

00:02:20.088 --> 00:02:22.056
PHILLIPS AND HIS CREW FROM

00:02:22.057 --> 00:02:24.258
DISTURBING THE CONGREGATION.

00:02:24.259 --> 00:02:26.894
PHILLIPS HAS A HISTORY OF

00:02:26.895 --> 00:02:27.361
CONFRONTATIONS.

00:02:27.362 --> 00:02:30.865
FOUR YEARS AGO HE TOLD A SIMILAR

00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:33.801
STORY CLAIMING WHITE STUDENTS IN

00:02:33.802 --> 00:02:36.070
MICHIGAN DISRESPECTED HIM AND

00:02:36.071 --> 00:02:37.738
THREW A BEER CAN AT HIM.

00:02:37.739 --> 00:02:39.740
HE WENT TO POLICE, BUT NO

00:02:39.741 --> 00:02:42.910
EVIDENCE TURNED UP TO SUPPORT

00:02:42.911 --> 00:02:43.878
HIS CLAIM.

00:02:43.879 --> 00:02:52.720
HE HAS A RAP SHEET INCLUDING

00:02:52.721 --> 00:02:54.989
NEGLIGENT DRIVING CHARGES.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:59.193
THERE HAS BEEN CONFUSION OVER

00:02:59.194 --> 00:03:01.529
HIS SERVICE DURING THE VOTE NAME

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.630
ERA.

00:03:02.631 --> 00:03:05.566
PHILLIPS CLAIMED HE SERVED IN

00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:08.402
VIETNAM AND WAS THE VICTIM OF

00:03:08.403 --> 00:03:11.872
UGLY PROTESTS UPON RETURNING.

00:03:11.873 --> 00:03:18.546
&gt;&gt; I AM A MARINE CORPS VET.

00:03:18.547 --> 00:03:23.317
I GOT AN HONORABLE DISCHARGE.

00:03:23.318 --> 00:03:26.921
WHAT MY BOX SAYS IS I WAS IN

00:03:26.922 --> 00:03:28.155
THEATER.

00:03:28.156 --> 00:03:30.224
I DON'T TALK MUCH ABOUT MY

00:03:30.225 --> 00:03:31.225
VIETNAM TIMES.

00:03:31.226 --> 00:03:34.728
WHEN I COME HOME, THOSE TIMES, I

00:03:34.729 --> 00:03:36.497
GOT SPIT ON.

00:03:36.498 --> 00:03:39.233
ACTUALLY SPIT ON, CALLED A BABY

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:39.567
KILLER.

00:03:39.568 --> 00:03:42.369
JESSE: THE MARINES SAY PHILLIPS

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:47.041
WAS A RESERVIST FROM 1972 TO

00:03:47.042 --> 00:03:50.244
976.

00:03:50.245 --> 00:03:52.847
WORKED ON REFRIGERATORS

00:03:52.848 --> 00:03:58.619
STATESIDE, NEVER DEPLOYED.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.956
AND HE WENT AWOL SEVERAL TIMES.

00:04:01.957 --> 00:04:04.892
HE WAS ASKED TO CLARIFY HIS

00:04:04.893 --> 00:04:05.459
SERVICE RECORD.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.862
&gt;&gt; I ALWAYS SAID I NEVER STEPPED

00:04:07.863 --> 00:04:09.730
FOOT IN SOUTH VIETNAM.

00:04:09.731 --> 00:04:12.766
I DON'T KNOW HOW MUCH CLEAR CAN

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:14.235
THAT BE?

00:04:14.236 --> 00:04:16.804
JESSE: HE COULD HAVE BEEN A SLOT

00:04:16.805 --> 00:04:18.639
CLEARER THERE.

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:23.711
IT'S CALLED SOLEN VALOR.

00:04:23.712 --> 00:04:27.882
HE'S A PROVOCATEUR.

00:04:27.883 --> 00:04:29.783
BUT HE WAS THE SOURCE FOR ALL

00:04:29.784 --> 00:04:31.952
THE MAINSTREAM OUTLETS WHO

00:04:31.953 --> 00:04:35.022
BOUGHT HIS NARRATIVE WITHOUT ANY

00:04:35.023 --> 00:04:38.260
CLARIFICATION AND USED IT TO

